## The friday/ folder

Every workflow capability I run writes to `friday/`. These files are my config, growing over time. `/new-capability` is the developer-tool exception: it scaffolds `commands/<name>.md` and may create `docs/skill-writing-playbook.md` on its first run.

- `friday/voice.md` - my voice profile (created by `/voice-installer`)
